# VidFlow Complete UX Flow

## Current State

**Backend:** ✅ Complete (337 tests, all nodes working)
**UI:** ❌ Empty shells — no input forms, no config panels, no modals

---

## The Missing Pieces

### 1. Pre-Run Modal (CRITICAL)
When user clicks "Run Pipeline", they need to:
- Enter a topic
- Select video archetype
- See cost estimate
- Confirm and start

### 2. Node Config Panels (CRITICAL)
When user clicks a node in Pipeline Editor:
- Slide-in panel from right
- Node-specific settings
- Preview where possible

### 3. Intervention Modal (CRITICAL)
When pipeline pauses for review:
- Show generated content
- Allow inline editing
- Approve / Regenerate / Skip

### 4. Channel Bible Editor (HIGH)
Global settings for brand voice:
- Tone, vocabulary, style
- Example scripts
- Persisted per project

