## Page-by-Page Requirements

### Dashboard (`/`)

**With Data:**
- Stats cards (videos published, runs, success rate, costs)
- Recent runs list with status indicators
- Quick actions (New Video, Continue Draft, View Templates)
- Upcoming scheduled runs

**Empty State:**
- Friendly illustration
- "Create your first automated video"
- Quick start wizard or template picker

### Pipeline Editor (`/editor`)

**Core:**
- React Flow canvas with YouTube watermark
- Draggable nodes from sidebar
- Click node → Config panel slides in
- "Run Pipeline" → Pre-run modal

**Toolbar:**
- Undo/redo
- Zoom controls
- Auto-layout button
- Save as template

### Run View (`/runs/[id]`)

**During Run:**
- Visual pipeline with live node status
- Progress bar
- Real-time logs (WebSocket)
- Intervention modal when paused

**After Run:**
- Final video preview
- All outputs (script, audio, thumbnail)
- Cost breakdown
- YouTube link (if published)

### Thumbnails (`/thumbnails`)

**Layout:** Krea-style (see previous spec)
- History sidebar (left)
- Large image grid (center)
- Prompt input (bottom)

### Settings (`/settings`)

**Sections:**
- API Keys (with test connection)
- YouTube Connection (OAuth)
- Channel Bible (inline or separate page)
- Defaults (voice, resolution, publish mode)
- Appearance (theme)

