## Technical Notes

### Pre-Run Modal State
```typescript
interface PreRunState {
  topic: string;
  archetypeId: string;
  interventionPoints: string[]; // ['script', 'thumbnail']
  overrides: {
    voice?: { voiceId: string };
    duration?: { min: number; max: number };
    publishMode?: 'draft' | 'private' | 'public';
  };
  costEstimate: CostEstimate;
}
```

### WebSocket Events
```typescript
// Server → Client
type RunEvent = 
  | { type: 'node_started'; nodeId: string }
  | { type: 'node_progress'; nodeId: string; percent: number; message: string }
  | { type: 'node_completed'; nodeId: string; output: unknown }
  | { type: 'node_failed'; nodeId: string; error: string }
  | { type: 'intervention_required'; nodeId: string; output: unknown }
  | { type: 'run_completed'; outputs: Record<string, unknown> }

// Client → Server
type InterventionResponse =
  | { type: 'approve' }
  | { type: 'approve_with_edits'; edits: unknown }
  | { type: 'regenerate'; feedback?: string }
  | { type: 'skip' }
```

### API Endpoints Needed
```
POST /api/runs                    # Create new run
GET  /api/runs/[id]               # Get run status
POST /api/runs/[id]/intervention  # Respond to intervention
WS   /api/runs/[id]/stream        # Real-time updates

GET  /api/archetypes              # List available archetypes
GET  /api/voices                  # List ElevenLabs voices
POST /api/voices/preview          # Preview voice

GET  /api/channel-bible           # Get channel bible
PUT  /api/channel-bible           # Update channel bible
```

